<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank adds o/n liquidity at avg 164.92pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank adds o/n liquidity at avg 164.92pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Wednesday that it added overnight liquidity to the market at the average yield of 164.92 percent.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it accepted 33 percent of bids at the minimum rate of 150 percent, while the maximum yiled reached 201 percent. The CNB did not disclose the total volume of the transactions.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
